    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Horror FPS That Will Test Your Nerves.</strong><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242090/extras/9b4202deabc3144731b3f58c60c097f9.avif?t=1754521511\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a world that has changed forever. A priest, obsessed with forbidden knowledge, performed a ritual that actually worked\u2014opening the gates of hell and unleashing chaos. Now, survival is your only goal in a place where creatures and humans can no longer coexist. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Creatures everywhere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They could come from any direction. Stay alert, keep your weapons ready, and protect yourself at all costs. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Haunting Atmosphere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arming yourself won\u2019t be enough. The dread runs deeper. The world is dark, tense, and filled with horrors that don\u2019t care how prepared you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every hallway, every shadow hides a threat\u2014and sometimes, it\u2019s not the creatures that scare you most. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intense gameplay and boss fights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242090/extras/2b1ad9492d73abba7e91cf8789159351.avif?t=1754521511\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against relentless enemies and terrifying bosses. You\u2019ll need skill, strategy, and a strong aim to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Nightmare Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242090/extras/be21735e17620a24bfcf273f0eebe746.avif?t=1754521511\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No checkpoints. Stronger enemies. No mercy. If you\u2019re brave enough, Nightmare Mode will push you to your limits. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapon Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242090/extras/7326653fb167c712fda71573fb657f38.avif?t=1754521511\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and equip mods to personalize your weapons. Adjust color, add attachments like scopes, flashlights, muzzles, bullet extensions, lasers, and more. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interactive Environments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and interact with your surroundings. You might discover useful items\u2014or unsettling secrets. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Quality Settings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust a wide range of visual settings to match your system. Supports 4K resolution and beyond for an immersive experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keymapping and Controller Support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242090/extras/78fd912814683b60ebfaa2f5bfd8de7c.avif?t=1754521511\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remap keys and tune camera sensitivity to fit your playstyle. Full controller support included. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple Saving and Loading</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and switch between different playthroughs without losing progress. No two runs need to be the same.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Horror FPS That Will Test Your Nerves.</strong><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242090/extras/9b4202deabc3144731b3f58c60c097f9.avif?t=1754521511\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a world that has changed forever. A priest, obsessed with forbidden knowledge, performed a ritual that actually worked\u2014opening the gates of hell and unleashing chaos. Now, survival is your only goal in a place where creatures and humans can no longer coexist. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Creatures everywhere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They could come from any direction. Stay alert, keep your weapons ready, and protect yourself at all costs. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Haunting Atmosphere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arming yourself won\u2019t be enough. The dread runs deeper. The world is dark, tense, and filled with horrors that don\u2019t care how prepared you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every hallway, every shadow hides a threat\u2014and sometimes, it\u2019s not the creatures that scare you most. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intense gameplay and boss fights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242090/extras/2b1ad9492d73abba7e91cf8789159351.avif?t=1754521511\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against relentless enemies and terrifying bosses. You\u2019ll need skill, strategy, and a strong aim to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Nightmare Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242090/extras/be21735e17620a24bfcf273f0eebe746.avif?t=1754521511\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No checkpoints. Stronger enemies. No mercy. If you\u2019re brave enough, Nightmare Mode will push you to your limits. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapon Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242090/extras/7326653fb167c712fda71573fb657f38.avif?t=1754521511\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and equip mods to personalize your weapons. Adjust color, add attachments like scopes, flashlights, muzzles, bullet extensions, lasers, and more. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interactive Environments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and interact with your surroundings. You might discover useful items\u2014or unsettling secrets. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Quality Settings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust a wide range of visual settings to match your system. Supports 4K resolution and beyond for an immersive experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keymapping and Controller Support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242090/extras/78fd912814683b60ebfaa2f5bfd8de7c.avif?t=1754521511\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remap keys and tune camera sensitivity to fit your playstyle. Full controller support included. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple Saving and Loading</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and switch between different playthroughs without losing progress. No two runs need to be the same.</p>",
    "short_description": "Arming yourself against these creatures doesn\u2019t mean you\u2019re safe from the horrors that lurk around every corner.",
